  "interpretation": "<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"971\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"969\"> Interpretation:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1324\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1088\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">This panel is used in the <strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1054\">histopathological evaluation of pituitary adenomas</strong> to determine hormonal activity.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1189\">\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1189\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Helps in <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1132\">classifying pituitary tumors</strong> as functioning (hormone-producing) or non-functioning.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1269\">\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1269\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Positive staining indicates expression of specific hormones by tumor cells.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1324\">\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1324\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Aids in treatment planning and prognosis assessment</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
